  "notes": "Refers specifically to religious or spiritual belief, not general beliefs or opinions.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{信仰|しんこう}の{自由|じゆう} (freedom of religion)\n・{信仰|しんこう}を{持|も}つ (to have faith)\n・{信仰|しんこう}{心|しん} (devoutness, piety)\n・{信仰|しんこう}{深|ぶか}い (deeply religious)\n\nHOMOPHONES (all しんこう):\n・{進行|しんこう} - progress, advance\n・{新興|しんこう} - rising, emerging\n・{振興|しんこう} - promotion, encouragement",
